## client → service
GET /api-ws/v1/inference
Authorization: Bearer <key>
→ text {"header":{"action":"run-task","streaming":"duplex","task_id":"<task-id>"},"payload":{"function":"recognition","input":{},"model":"fun-asr-realtime","parameters":{"format":"pcm","sample_rate":16000},"task":"asr","task_group":"audio"}}
→ binary 3200 bytes ×10
(server closes: 1011 Internal server error)

## events
error: kind=server code=StatusInternalError retryable detail=Internal server error
